<p>Your hateful will splinters into the minds of those you torture, breaking them down. Each time you inflict Mind damage, the victim has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8.0%, 12%, 14%, 16%, 18%</acronym> chance of going mad for 3 turns unless they save against your Mindpower. The madness will lower the victim's Mind resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 20%, 26%, 29%, 32%</acronym> and cause them to become confused (50% power), slowed (30% power), or stunned for the duration.</p>